      "content": "The progressive monologue cut off right at the end, can you finish Jax's speech? Also, looking at these, I feel like the contrast is a bit too lopsided. Eleanor sounds very grounded and poetic, but Jax sounds almost unhinged and purely reactive. Can you rewrite Jax's part so they sound just as intelligent and composed as Eleanor, even if they are being more urgent? I want them to be a worthy intellectual opponent, not just someone who sounds angry.",
